# Copy to .env only if you want a live AI. `.env` holds only the AI_* settings
# and TEST_MODE; every other setting comes from the environment, compose.yaml or
# Vercel. Without an AI key the app runs in Test mode on recorded answers.
# Names only: nothing here carries a value. FEATURE_* flags default in
# config.ts; set one only to override its default.

# APP_ENV
# TEST_MODE
# AI_PROVIDER (only `openrouter` is valid; any other value fails after a Daily-cap slot is used)
# AI_MODEL (an OpenRouter model id, for example anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5)
# AI_RETENTION_DAYS
# AI_API_KEY (an OpenRouter key)
# DATABASE_URL
# SECRETS_FILE
# ENCRYPTION_KEY
# ACCESS_CODE
# FEATURE_ACCOUNTS
# FEATURE_GAPS
# FEATURE_REWORDING
# FEATURE_KEYWORD_FALLBACK

# Only for `scripts/bake-off.ts` (Story 3.3; OpenRouter only since 3.3d); see docs/qa/bake-off-runbook.md.
# BAKE_OFF_OPENROUTER_KEY
# BAKE_OFF_OPENROUTER_MODELS
